    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Social courtesy formulas",
     "texto": [
      "In everyday situations standard polite replies are used: «Dank u wel» (thank you very much, formal) or «Dank je wel» (informal). The usual reply to this is «Graag gedaan» (you're welcome / with pleasure). When apologising for an oversight («Sorry, ik ben mijn afspraak vergeten»), the other person usually reassures with «Geen probleem» (no problem / no worries)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
